 dial things  back slightly with Somerville  [Music]  Somerville is the Sci-Fi puzzle  Adventure debut of Studio Gem Ship which  is made up of some of the folks that  brought us Classics like limbo and  inside following a similar style to  those games Somerville will have you  traversing a civilization in the midst  of a cosmic hostile attack forcing you  to make amends with your family in the  face of an utter catastrophe through  ravaged forests and Fallen cities you  have to find the whereabouts of your  family while dealing with an alien  invasion the game features a stark yet  vibrant art style despite its rather  dire narrative  and like limbo and inside you'll be  solving environmental puzzles and often  running for your life and hiding to  maneuver dangerous encounters  additionally observing aliens at times  will be vital in your survival and how  to understand their technology  based on real events the legend of Tian  ding is a beat-em-up set in 20th century  type pay where you play as Leon Tian  ding a sort of Robin Hood style  vigilante that robs the rich feeds the  poor and serves Fists Full of Justice  this is a stylized hard-hitting action  game that is just bursting at the seams  with grit and fists most impressively is  how well it manages to incorporate its  Chinese manga art style into the game  itself using Illustrated panels as a way  to emphasize moments and even attacks in  a way that feels really reminiscent of  something like Beautiful Joe and I am a  hundred percent here for it  Ghost Song is an absolute Cosmic Terror  with a striking art style that is as  dark as it is dazzling you are a dead  suit long dormant now awaken on a  desolate Moon that is stricken with  Mysteries twisting Caverns secrets and  Galactic monstrosities in proper  metroidvania fashion you'll explore the  world discovering secret places its  haunting history and of course new  abilities that allow you to backtrack  and slowly unlock the world but not  without scary sp